OL,3,ANew EU industry rules would damage UK,
OL,4,Awarns Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has warned that planned EU
OL,7,Frules to help European manufacturers
OL,8,Fwould damage the UK, ahead of a meeting
OL,9,Flater with European Commission
OL,10,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen.
OL,12,FThe proposals aim to protect EU
OL,13,Findustry from Chinese competitors by
OL,14,Fgiving companies inside the bloc
OL,15,Fpriority for public contracts and
OL,16,Fsubsidies.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
